    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... the pressure is everywhere. i feel like even if i sleep, i'm just waking up to the same nightmare. sometimes i just lay in the dark and think about how much easier it would be if i just didn't have to wake up tomorrow. if i could just sleep and never have to deal with this heaviness again. that doesn't sound crazy, does it? like, i just want peace.",
